### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/task

### Get one task by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/task/{task-id}

### Create task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish the project report",
  "description": "Review final notes and send the summary",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-20T00:00:00",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/task/{task-id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish the project report",
  "description": "Updated notes and final summary",
  "status": "Blocked",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-25T00:00:00",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/task/{task-id}
